],"evidence":[{"id":"lizang-q-45b0aacbba69dbd57302","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-76f360b0363911f34631","layer":"original","quote":"立而不跪。羽谓曰：“卿兄在汉中。我欲以卿为将，不早降何为？”德骂羽曰：“竖子，何谓降也！魏王带甲百万，威振天下。汝刘备庸才耳，岂能敌邪？我宁为国家鬼，不为贼将也！”遂为羽所杀","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":87},{"id":"lizang-q-4ef32b63a7f5ff4d8c5b","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-600ec9e048958a94c35d","layer":"original","quote":"德常曰：“我受国恩，义在效死〖4〗。我欲身自击羽。今年我不杀羽，羽当杀我","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":94,"end":130},{"id":"lizang-q-56bae898459683465bc1","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-600ec9e048958a94c35d","layer":"original","quote":"遂南屯樊，讨关羽","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":63,"end":71},{"id":"lizang-q-66c8264ad0149c8289af","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-cc028a9b73eabe99bd16","layer":"original","quote":"仁使德屯樊北十里","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8},{"id":"lizang-q-ae7afaab0329f7bde126","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-cc028a9b73eabe99bd16","layer":"original","quote":"将军董衡、部曲将董超等欲降，德皆收斩之","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":66,"end":85},{"id":"lizang-q-d1ff6efce8f94c6690bb","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-cc028a9b73eabe99bd16","layer":"original","quote":"会天霖雨十余日，汉水暴溢；樊下平地五六丈，德与诸将避水，上堤。羽乘船攻之，以大船四面射堤上。德被甲持弓，箭不虚发","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":9,"end":65},{"id":"lizang-q-d43cbf6f9121717251c4","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-54a51096c7c075758eb4","layer":"original","quote":"德谓督将成何曰：“吾闻良将不怯死以苟免，烈士不毁节以求生；今日，我死日也","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36},{"id":"lizang-q-d5573e7894d8f4ba3e69","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-54a51096c7c075758eb4","layer":"original","quote":"战益怒，气愈壮；而水浸盛，吏士皆降。德与麾下将一人，伍伯二人〖5〗，弯弓傅矢〖6〗，乘小船，欲还仁营；水盛船覆，失弓矢；独抱船覆水中，为羽所得","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":109},{"id":"lizang-q-e8c144058b1ba9ddbc2c","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-600ec9e048958a94c35d","layer":"original","quote":"后亲与羽交战，射羽中额","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":132,"end":143},{"id":"lizang-q-ee14036e58a0b89ec583","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-cc028a9b73eabe99bd16","layer":"original","quote":"自平旦力战至日过中，羽攻益急；矢尽，短兵接战","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":86,"end":108},{"id":"wudi-e-o197b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01554a0b2561dc520574","layer":"original","quote":"遣于禁助曹仁，击关羽。八月，汉水溢，灌禁军，军没。羽获禁，遂围仁。使徐晃救之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":55}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
